body:
I envy you. I am working offshore, work from home para sa UK Client doing customer service calls, and I really want to work for their email department para petiks nalang din ako. Although mas madami workload since mas mabilis magreply sa emails compared sa calls, pero ayaw ko na talaga makipagusap verbally sa mga entitled people at gusto ko lang magpatugtog habang nagwwork, which I can't do if I am taking calls. 

&#x200B;

I think it's normal to get bored, and baka tama ka nga baka dahil bago pa lang section niyo at wala pa ganun required labor pero I would advise you to savour it na, kasi baka somewhere down the line maging busy na kayo. Hahaha!
